                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "AKash-A007",
                        "email": "mirrorghost007@gmail.com",
                        "username": "AKash-A007"
                    },
                    "message": "Thanks for your review. I've split the change into two separate commits based on the discussion:\n\n1. **Change 90364** (this one): Updates `storage_chassis.hpp` to use the PrettyName utility\n2. **Change 91706**: Creates the reusable `pretty_name.hpp` utility file\n\nThis way the utility can be reviewed independently and then reused for other components \n(Processors, Memory, Chassis, etc.) in future changes.\n\nThe CI failure on this change is due to pre-existing clang-tidy warnings in `dbus_utils.cpp`\nthat are unrelated to my change.\n\nPTAL.\n\nChange 91706: https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/bmcweb/+/91706"
                }
            ],
